extracted wave phase; its decay is obtained from its nonstationary meridian
integral instead. -/
def coordinateWaveRadialPhase (part : CoordinateWavePart) (a : Real) : Real :=
  match part with
  | .outgoing => -(2 * Real.pi * a)
  | .incoming => 2 * Real.pi * a
  | .middle => 0

